{"content_hash": "675b3687ace63cc1", "version_id": 184, "article_id": 19, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Arteta Becomes Premier League's Highest-Paid Manager on £20m-a-Year Deal", "title_zh": "阿尔特塔签下年薪2000万英镑新合同，成为英超薪酬最高的主教练", "topic": "sports", "source": "skysports", "source_url": "https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12040/13596325/arsenal-manager-mikel-arteta-becomes-premier-leagues-highest-paid-boss-on-20m-a-year-new-contract-paper-talk", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://e2.365dm.com/26/08/1920x1080/skysports-paper-talk-football_7317647.jpg?20260809160824", "credit": ""}, "published_date": "2026-10-07", "word_count": 294, "reading_minutes": 1.5, "lead": "Mikel Arteta has signed a new contract that makes him the Premier League's highest-paid manager. The deal is worth £20 million a year, according to newspaper reports.", "lead_zh": "米克尔·阿尔特塔签下了一份新合同，成为英超薪酬最高的主教练。据报纸报道，这份合同价值每年2000万英镑。", "preview": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta has become the Premier League's highest-paid boss after agreeing a new contract worth £20 million a year. The n", "preview_zh": "阿森纳主教练米克尔·阿尔特塔在同意一份年薪2000万英镑的新合同后，成为英超薪酬最高的主教练。据《每日邮报》周三报道，阿尔特塔的新合同使他超越了英格兰顶级联赛的所有其他主教练。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 174, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/audio/19/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 118.075, "size_bytes": 712224, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 331, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/data/versions/184.json", "paragraphs": ["Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta has become the Premier League's highest-paid boss after agreeing a new contract worth £20 million a year. The news was reported by the Daily Mail on Wednesday. Arteta's new deal puts him above all other managers in the English top flight.", "Liverpool are considering another blockbuster signing to strengthen their already expensive attacking line-up, according to the Daily Star. Meanwhile, the agent of Gianluigi Donnarumma, Enzo Raiola, has said Manchester City gave his client reassurances after the club's recent guilty verdict, the Daily Mirror reports.", "Kieran McKenna has found a new job as a technical observer for UEFA, just months after leaving Ipswich. The Sun reported the news. Elsewhere, former Premier League star Cheikhou Kouyate has revealed that he spent years battling a heart condition, which he kept secret throughout his playing career, according to the Daily Mirror.", "In England news, Thomas Tuchel says the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer, after England impressed in his absence during the Nations League camp. The Evening Standard reported these comments.", "In Scottish football, Lawrence Shankland has given a major update on his hamstring injury and recovery, the Scottish Sun reports. Hibernian have confirmed that an Easter Road fan favourite and a former Celtic star will join new first-team boss Marink Reedijk's backroom team.", "Elsewhere, Lionel Messi was strangely given a yellow and red card by the referee who took charge of his final game for Argentina, according to the Daily Mail. Matildas star Mary Fowler has reportedly returned to Australia to be with her injured boyfriend, Nathan Cleary, after her sudden withdrawal from international duty left senior football officials unimpressed. In Formula 1, Rwanda looks set to beat South Africa as the sport nears a permanent return to Africa, The Independent says."], "paragraphs_zh": ["阿森纳主教练米克尔·阿尔特塔在同意一份年薪2000万英镑的新合同后，成为英超薪酬最高的主教练。据《每日邮报》周三报道，阿尔特塔的新合同使他超越了英格兰顶级联赛的所有其他主教练。", "据《每日星报》报道，利物浦正在考虑另一笔重磅签约，以加强本已昂贵的进攻线。与此同时，据《每日镜报》报道，吉安路易吉·多纳鲁马的经纪人恩佐·拉伊奥拉表示，曼城在俱乐部最近的 guilty 判决后向他的客户提供了保证。", "基兰·麦肯纳在离开伊普斯维奇几个月后，找到了新工作，担任欧足联的技术观察员。《太阳报》报道了这一消息。另外，据《每日镜报》报道，前英超球星谢库·库亚特透露，他多年来一直在与心脏病作斗争，并在整个职业生涯中对此保密。", "在英格兰新闻方面，托马斯·图赫尔表示，在没有科尔·帕尔默的情况下，“列车正在前进”，此前英格兰在欧国联训练营中在他缺席的情况下表现出色。《 Evening Standard》报道了这些评论。", "在苏格兰足球方面，据《苏格兰太阳报》报道，劳伦斯·尚克兰就他的腿筋伤势和恢复情况提供了重要更新。希伯尼安已确认，一位复活节路球迷的最爱和一位前凯尔特人球星将加入新一线队主教练马林克·里迪克的后台团队。", "在其他地方，据《每日邮报》报道，莱昂内尔·梅西在阿根廷队的最后一场比赛中，被当值裁判奇怪地出示了黄牌和红牌。据《每日邮报》报道，玛蒂尔达斯球星玛丽·福勒在突然退出国际比赛后，已返回澳大利亚陪伴受伤的男友内森·克利里，这让高级足球官员感到不满。据《独立报》报道，在F1方面，随着这项运动接近永久重返非洲，卢旺达似乎将击败南非。"], "body": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta has become the Premier League's highest-paid boss after agreeing a new contract worth £20 million a year. The news was reported by the Daily Mail on Wednesday. Arteta's new deal puts him above all other managers in the English top flight.\n\nLiverpool are considering another blockbuster signing to strengthen their already expensive attacking line-up, according to the Daily Star. Meanwhile, the agent of Gianluigi Donnarumma, Enzo Raiola, has said Manchester City gave his client reassurances after the club's recent guilty verdict, the Daily Mirror reports.\n\nKieran McKenna has found a new job as a technical observer for UEFA, just months after leaving Ipswich. The Sun reported the news. Elsewhere, former Premier League star Cheikhou Kouyate has revealed that he spent years battling a heart condition, which he kept secret throughout his playing career, according to the Daily Mirror.\n\nIn England news, Thomas Tuchel says the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer, after England impressed in his absence during the Nations League camp. The Evening Standard reported these comments.\n\nIn Scottish football, Lawrence Shankland has given a major update on his hamstring injury and recovery, the Scottish Sun reports. Hibernian have confirmed that an Easter Road fan favourite and a former Celtic star will join new first-team boss Marink Reedijk's backroom team.\n\nElsewhere, Lionel Messi was strangely given a yellow and red card by the referee who took charge of his final game for Argentina, according to the Daily Mail. Matildas star Mary Fowler has reportedly returned to Australia to be with her injured boyfriend, Nathan Cleary, after her sudden withdrawal from international duty left senior football officials unimpressed. In Formula 1, Rwanda looks set to beat South Africa as the sport nears a permanent return to Africa, The Independent says.", "body_zh": "阿森纳主教练米克尔·阿尔特塔在同意一份年薪2000万英镑的新合同后，成为英超薪酬最高的主教练。据《每日邮报》周三报道，阿尔特塔的新合同使他超越了英格兰顶级联赛的所有其他主教练。\n\n据《每日星报》报道，利物浦正在考虑另一笔重磅签约，以加强本已昂贵的进攻线。与此同时，据《每日镜报》报道，吉安路易吉·多纳鲁马的经纪人恩佐·拉伊奥拉表示，曼城在俱乐部最近的 guilty 判决后向他的客户提供了保证。\n\n基兰·麦肯纳在离开伊普斯维奇几个月后，找到了新工作，担任欧足联的技术观察员。《太阳报》报道了这一消息。另外，据《每日镜报》报道，前英超球星谢库·库亚特透露，他多年来一直在与心脏病作斗争，并在整个职业生涯中对此保密。\n\n在英格兰新闻方面，托马斯·图赫尔表示，在没有科尔·帕尔默的情况下，“列车正在前进”，此前英格兰在欧国联训练营中在他缺席的情况下表现出色。《 Evening Standard》报道了这些评论。\n\n在苏格兰足球方面，据《苏格兰太阳报》报道，劳伦斯·尚克兰就他的腿筋伤势和恢复情况提供了重要更新。希伯尼安已确认，一位复活节路球迷的最爱和一位前凯尔特人球星将加入新一线队主教练马林克·里迪克的后台团队。\n\n在其他地方，据《每日邮报》报道，莱昂内尔·梅西在阿根廷队的最后一场比赛中，被当值裁判奇怪地出示了黄牌和红牌。据《每日邮报》报道，玛蒂尔达斯球星玛丽·福勒在突然退出国际比赛后，已返回澳大利亚陪伴受伤的男友内森·克利里，这让高级足球官员感到不满。据《独立报》报道，在F1方面，随着这项运动接近永久重返非洲，卢旺达似乎将击败南非。", "text": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta has become the Premier League's highest-paid boss after agreeing a new contract worth £20 million a year. The news was reported by the Daily Mail on Wednesday. Arteta's new deal puts him above all other managers in the English top flight. Liverpool are considering another blockbuster signing to strengthen their already expensive attacking line-up, according to the Daily Star. Meanwhile, the agent of Gianluigi Donnarumma, Enzo Raiola, has said Manchester City gave his client reassurances after the club's recent guilty verdict, the Daily Mirror reports. Kieran McKenna has found a new job as a technical observer for UEFA, just months after leaving Ipswich. The Sun reported the news. Elsewhere, former Premier League star Cheikhou Kouyate has revealed that he spent years battling a heart condition, which he kept secret throughout his playing career, according to the Daily Mirror. In England news, Thomas Tuchel says the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer, after England impressed in his absence during the Nations League camp. The Evening Standard reported these comments. In Scottish football, Lawrence Shankland has given a major update on his hamstring injury and recovery, the Scottish Sun reports. Hibernian have confirmed that an Easter Road fan favourite and a former Celtic star will join new first-team boss Marink Reedijk's backroom team. Elsewhere, Lionel Messi was strangely given a yellow and red card by the referee who took charge of his final game for Argentina, according to the Daily Mail. Matildas star Mary Fowler has reportedly returned to Australia to be with her injured boyfriend, Nathan Cleary, after her sudden withdrawal from international duty left senior football officials unimpressed. In Formula 1, Rwanda looks set to beat South Africa as the sport nears a permanent return to Africa, The Independent says.", "vocab": [{"word": "highest-paid", "pos": "adj", "zh": "薪酬最高的", "note": "常用于描述工资最高的人"}, {"word": "contract", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合同", "note": "法律或商业协议"}, {"word": "blockbuster", "pos": "adj", "zh": "重磅的", "note": "形容非常成功或昂贵的事物"}, {"word": "line-up", "pos": "noun", "zh": "阵容", "note": "指团队或球队的成员"}, {"word": "agent", "pos": "noun", "zh": "经纪人", "note": "代表运动员或艺人的人"}, {"word": "reassurance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "保证，安慰", "note": "消除疑虑的话或行为"}, {"word": "verdict", "pos": "noun", "zh": "裁决，判决", "note": "法庭或官方决定"}, {"word": "technical observer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "技术观察员", "note": "分析比赛的专业人员"}, {"word": "battling", "pos": "verb", "zh": "斗争，抗争", "note": "努力应对困难"}, {"word": "hamstring", "pos": "noun", "zh": "腿筋", "note": "大腿后侧的肌肉"}, {"word": "backroom team", "pos": "noun", "zh": "后台团队", "note": "教练和支持人员"}, {"word": "withdrawal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "退出", "note": "离开或退出某项活动"}], "title_original": "Papers: Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year", "summary_original": "The top stories and transfer rumours from Wednesday's newspapers...", "body_original": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year new contract - Paper Talk\nPlus: Liverpool weigh up another blockbuster signing to add to their mega